  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>We know, Viscosity<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo></math>Pascal<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8208;</mo></math>second</p><p>Let&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mi>&#951;</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>P</mi><mi>x</mi></msup><msup><mi>A</mi><mi>y</mi></msup><msup><mi>T</mi><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>y</mi></msup><msup><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><msup><mrow><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi></mrow><mn>1</mn></msup></mfenced><mi>z</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">y</mi></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>From above, we have&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;&#160;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"/><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p>Solving above three equations, we get&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>So, Viscosity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mn>1</mn></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>0</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
